  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He is a Northern Plains lone Gu Immortal, rank seven on wood path and titled Wooden Statue Lord. Hunting a yellowish ancient desolate ginseng in Huang Jin bloodline territory, he pins roots with greenish grey wooden spikes and unleashes Decaying Wooden Death, only to learn the trunk he struck was a branch of a plant near rank eight. Grey shadows let roots pass through him or hold him fixed while immortal essence drains, and he fears dying to the plant until Fairy Black Moon’s dark capital strength tiger and Chen Cheng’s arrival kill it and save him. He cups his fists to Chen Cheng, then swears he will not forget the life debt and will do his best to repay her. Told to lead the way to Crescent Moon Mound because he is close to Yin Wu Que, he hesitates for his good friend Brother Yin, then complies rather than defy her.",
      "chapters": [
        2167
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "move_decaying_wooden_death",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_chen_cheng",
        "char_yin_wu_que"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is bare chested, well proportioned, with bulging muscles, an ordinary face, a sharp nose, and pursed lips that give an impression of perseverance.",
      "chapters": [
        2167
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "As Wooden Statue Lord Wu Guang he spectates Fairy Black Moon’s duel with Yin Wu Que beside Sincerity Immortal Chen Cheng, eyelids twitching with shared pain as punches land.",
      "chapters": [
        2169
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crescent-moon-spectating",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He urges Fairy Black Moon to spare Yin Wu Que once defeat is admitted, then treats Yin Wu Que on the ground. After she thrashes Liu Chang and Liu Luo he is tongue-tied, tells Brother Yin it was lucky to survive her temperament, and asks helplessly whether they should help the Liu siblings. When Yin Wu Que joins her entourage, he says he will come along too, calling it interesting and wanting to watch with his own eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        2170
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "entourage-after-liu-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liu_chang",
        "char_liu_luo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He watches her public fight with Liu Chang among lone and demonic supporters, transmits that Lady Black Moon has the upper hand, and discusses with Yin Wu Que whether her rising battle strength is hidden power or closed cultivation connecting with experience. Narration notes that he, Yin Wu Que, and others followed her on their own initiative under forceful Huang Jin recruitment pressure. He fails to see the winged dark capital strength biao clearly when it first condenses.",
      "chapters": [
        2188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "black-moon-challenges",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During Fairy Black Moon’s duel with Chu Du he excitedly asks whether Chu Du is admitting defeat. After Chu Du wins yet saves her from backlash, he is named with Yin Wu Que and Chen Cheng among supporters who still secretly feel admiration toward Chu Du.",
      "chapters": [
        2214
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chu-du-duel-watch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chu_du"
      ]
    }
  ],
